  "final_message": "Everything verified. Final state:\n\n## What we did\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, single file, Flask + stdlib sqlite3):\n- Schema: `users`, `tokens`, `books`, `reviews` (`UNIQUE(book_id,user_id)`, FK cascade)\n- Endpoints: health, register (201), login (200 + token), books CRUD (list/search/paging, create 201, put 200, delete 204), reviews (list newest-first, one per user \u2192 409)\n- PBKDF2 password hashing, `Bearer` token auth, validation errors as `{\"error\", \"errors\": {field: msg}}`\n- Serves `frontend/dist` with SPA fallback; `/api/*` unknown \u2192 JSON 404; missing assets \u2192 404 (fixed this session)\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + Vite + Tailwind v4):\n- Custom path router, pages for book list/search/paging, detail+reviews, add/edit forms, sign-in/register\n- `localStorage` session, 401 \u2192 redirect to login with banner, delete uses `confirm()`\n- `tsc --noEmit && vite build` passes; `npm ci` in sync\n\n**Verification this session:**\n- Full E2E suite against gunicorn on :8000 \u2014 **64/64 checks pass** (auth, validation, ordering, pagination, search, average-rating rounding, cascade delete, token rejection, SPA/asset serving)\n- Fixed: missing `/assets/*` returned index.html instead of 404 (`backend/app.py:478`)\n- Rebuilt dist after the App/BooksPage edits; new assets serve correctly\n\n**Not run:** Docker build (no docker here), browser UI test (no browser). Server currently running on `:8000` with test data in `data/library.db`.",
